    {
      "id": 140502,
      "type": "Skill",
      "name": { "en": "Fractal, Exiles Fallacy", "zh-CN": "分形，驱逐虚知" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Deals Wind DMG equal to #1[i]% of Anaxa's ATK to one designated enemy and additionally deals #2[i] instance(s) of DMG. Each instance of DMG deals Wind DMG equal to #1[i]% of Anaxa's ATK to one random enemy, prioritizing Bouncing to enemy targets that have not been hit by this instance of Skill.\nWhen used, for each attackable enemy on the field, this Skill has its DMG dealt increased by #3[i]%.",
        "zh-CN": "对指定敌方单体造成等同于那刻夏#1[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害，并额外造成#2[i]次伤害。每次伤害对敌方随机单体造成等同于那刻夏#1[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害，优先弹射本次战技尚未击中过的敌方目标。\n施放时场上每有1个可攻击的敌方目标，本次战技造成的伤害提高#3[i]%。"
      },
