    {
      "id": 140503,
      "type": "Ultimate",
      "name": { "en": "Sprouting Life Sculpts Earth", "zh-CN": "生息破土，世界塑造" },
      "description": {
        "en": "Inflicts the \"Sublimation\" state on all enemies, then deals Wind DMG equal to #1[i]% of Anaxa's ATK to all enemies.\nIn the \"Sublimation\" state, the targets will be simultaneously inflicted with Physical, Fire, Ice, Lightning, Wind, Quantum, and Imaginary Weaknesses, lasting until the start of the targets' turn. If the targets do not have Control RES, they are unable to take action in the \"Sublimation\" state.",
        "zh-CN": "使敌方全体陷入【升华】状态，随后对敌方全体造成等同于那刻夏#1[i]%攻击力的风属性伤害。\n【升华】状态下，目标同时被添加物理、火、冰、雷、风、量子、虚数属性弱点，持续至目标回合开始时。若目标不具有控制抵抗，则【升华】状态下无法行动。"
      },
